    uv sync --dev
    uv run pre-commit install
    just lint && just test && just dogfood

### Release setup

Run `uv lock` and commit `uv.lock` (CI uses `uv sync --locked`). Configure the PyPI Trusted Publisher for workflow `release.yml` and environment `pypi` (give the environment a required reviewer and a `main` branch policy). Enable the repository setting "Allow GitHub Actions to create and approve pull requests" so release-please can open release PRs. `.github/workflows/release.yml` is a copy of Shipwright's own release workflow: re-sync it when you update the template.

